915	     * an existing owner's. Because the (normalized) telephone is part of the key, two members of the same
916	     * household (same {@code householdId}) with different telephones have different keys and are both
917	     * allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate. The owner's {@code householdId} has already
918	     * been computed (deterministically from the last name and postcode) before this check runs, so the
