     * {@value #LARGE_HOUSEHOLD_POINTS} for a household of {@value #LARGE_HOUSEHOLD_SIZE} or more members, and
     * {@value #TENURE_POINTS} for a tenure of at least {@value #TENURE_POINTS_FISCAL_YEARS} elapsed fiscal
